<title>NETHERLANDS: Nedlloyd 1996 net falls to NLG 49 mln.</title>
<headline>Nedlloyd 1996 net falls to NLG 49 mln.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996 year.</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   49	vs  106</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		 1.25   vs    1.25</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (guilders)    2.16  vs    4.72</p>
<p>    Net from normal operations	53     vs   79</p>
<p>    EPS from normal ops (guilders)   2.16  vs    3.42</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  6.83  vs    6.77</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   104     vs  138</p>
<p>    Income from associates	    62     vs   71</p>
<p>    Interest charge		     99     vs  122</p>
<p>    Tax charge			    14     vs    8</p>
<p>    Minority interests	    loss 4     vs    2 loss</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income	 nil     vs   29</p>
<p>Note - Koninklijke Nedlloyd Groep NV is a shipping and road transport group.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
